# pubspec.lock is committed on purpose. This is an application, not a
# library: the lockfile is what makes a build reproducible, and
# docker/Dockerfile.web copies it before resolving. It was ignored, and the
# web image turned out not to build from a clean checkout at all — only from
# a working tree that happened to have the file.
#
# Other lockfiles stay out; add them by name if any appear.
ios/Flutter/ephemeral/

